      "raw": "<p>I just want to make sure I have this right.&nbsp; If Illusory Demon is chosen as the target of an Ongoing that causes damage to be dealt, such as Impale, and that damage destroys the demon, since the &quot;when this card is destroyed&quot; effects resolve in card-play order, Impale&#39;s &quot;the target is gone, so destroy this&quot; doesn&#39;t happen until after the Demon&#39;s &quot;destroy an Ongoing&quot; happens, and so you can (and probably should) choose Impale as the destroyed Ongoing, just before it would be destroyed anyway.&nbsp; Agreed?</p>",
